  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Though you speak in a gentle whisper, a soft wind carries your words far away.</p><p>Choose a target you can see within <strong>50 spaces</strong>. You may speak up to 10 words to the creature that only it can hear.</p><p>Alternatively, you may speak to a creature you know within 1 kilometer of you, so long as you begin the message with their name.</p><p>Each extra success increases your word limit by <strong>+10</strong>.</p><p>A creature spoken to in this manner may reply with a whisper of their own. Their reply must be 10 words or less.</p>",
